{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19152","headline":"阙下待传点呈诸同舍 · 刘禹锡","name":"阙下待传点呈诸同舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁漏晨钟声欲绝，旌旗组绶影相交。\n殿含佳气当龙首，阁倚晴天见凤巢。\n山色葱笼丹槛外，霞光泛灧翠松梢。\n多慙再入金门籍，不敢爲文学解嘲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}